      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Can access be revoked? The answer governs corrections.\n• Is the subscription ID sufficient? Product and engineering to confirm.\n• Does the registry already feed the lake? The join could happen there.\n• Can history share Entitlements Postgres? Who provisions it?\n• Where should it run (Cloud Run Jobs, Kubernetes or a Rundeck node)?\n• How does CDC handle DROP PARTITION and DELETE?\n• Who owns the registry read replica or view, and what is the lead time?\n• Can orders reconstruct effective dates for a closed month?",
      "originalText": "• Can access be revoked? The answer governs corrections.\n• Is the subscription ID sufficient? Product and engineering to confirm.\n• Does the registry already feed the lake? The join could happen there.\n• Can history share Entitlements Postgres? Who provisions it?\n• Where should it run (Cloud Run Jobs, Kubernetes or a Rundeck node)?\n• How does CDC handle DROP PARTITION and DELETE?\n• Who owns the registry read replica or view, and what is the lead time?\n• Can orders reconstruct effective dates for a closed month?",
