      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• B: use subscription-grain grants at the 158M-subscription study scale\n• A: roughly 4.7 billion rows per month makes per-item materialization impractical\n• C: consider files at subscription grain, matching B\n• A registry replica or view introduces a DBA dependency for delivery\n• At study scale, per-item expansion dominates modeled cost",
      "originalText": "• B: use subscription-grain grants at the 158M-subscription study scale\n• A: roughly 4.7 billion rows per month makes per-item materialization impractical\n• C: consider files at subscription grain, matching B\n• A registry replica or view introduces a DBA dependency for delivery\n• At study scale, per-item expansion dominates modeled cost",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 6,
