      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Proposal for review · Option A is the baseline after an engineering discussion · Redis was ruled out for this workflow's transactional needs · Scale assumption: 158 million active subscriptions\nSubscription is the key · Monthly processing with daily backfill · No replica for Entitlements Postgres. Read it in small batches. Read the registry through a replica or materialized view because direct database access and an API are outside the source team's scope.",
      "originalText": "Proposal for review · Option A is the baseline after an engineering discussion · Redis was ruled out for this workflow's transactional needs · Scale assumption: 158 million active subscriptions\nSubscription is the key · Monthly processing with daily backfill · No replica for Entitlements Postgres. Read it in small batches. Read the registry through a replica or materialized view because direct database access and an API are outside the source team's scope.",
      "fontSize": 20.25,
